  "register.md.tmpl": "---\nspec_version: \"{{spec_version}}\"\ngenerated_at: \"{{generated_at}}\"\nopen_items: {{open_items}}\nanchors:\n{{#each anchors}}\n  {{repo}}: {{sha}}\n{{/each}}\n---\n\n# Records of processing activities\n\n- Organisation: {{organisation}}\n- Generated at: {{generated_at}}\n\nRecords of processing activities of the controller, GDPR Art. 30(1), one section per processing activity. The Source column says where each value comes from; `To complete` means that no source gives the value and a person has to fill it in. How this document is built: `templates/register/README.md` in the compliance-spec repository.\n\n> Prepared for review by the controller and its data protection officer. This document does not certify compliance with the GDPR.\n\n## Open items\n\n{{open_summary}}\n\n| Processing activity | Open items |\n| --- | --- |\n{{#each open}}\n| {{name}} | {{items}} |\n{{/each}}\n\nJoint controller and representative are not counted: the processing format of v0.1 has no field for them, so they always read `To complete` and a person confirms them by hand.\n\n{{#each processings}}\n## {{name}} ({{id}})\n\n| Item | Value | Source |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n{{#each rows}}\n| {{item}} | {{value}} | {{source}} |\n{{/each}}\n\n{{/each}}\n",
  "register.en.md.tmpl": "---\nspec_version: \"{{spec_version}}\"\nlanguage: {{language}}\ngenerated_at: \"{{generated_at}}\"\nopen_items: {{open_items}}\nactions: {{action_count}}\nanchors:\n{{#each anchors}}\n  {{repo}}: \"{{sha}}\"\n{{/each}}\n---\n\n# Compliance dossier\n\n- Organisation: {{organisation}}\n- Generated at: {{generated_at}}\n\nCompliance dossier of the organisation, built from its compliance repo: the organisation's identity, the actions that close the open items, then for each processing activity its records of processing (GDPR Art. 30(1)) and its DPO checks, the AI features, and what stays outside the register. The Source column says where each value comes from; `To complete` means that no source gives the value and a person has to fill it in. How this document is built: `templates/register/README.md` in the compliance-spec repository.\n\n> Prepared for review by the controller and its data protection officer. This document does not certify compliance with the GDPR or the AI Act.\n\n## Organisation\n\n| Item | Value | Source |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n{{#each organisation_rows}}\n| {{item}} | {{value}} | {{source}} |\n{{/each}}\n\n## Actions\n\n{{actions_summary}}\n\n| Action | Role | Open items closed | Where |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n{{#each actions}}\n| `{{id}}`: {{label}} | {{role}} | {{count}} | {{where}} |\n{{/each}}\n\n{{#each processings}}\n## {{name}} ({{id}})\n\n### Records of processing, GDPR Art. 30(1)\n\n| Item | Value | Source |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n{{#each rows}}\n| {{item}} | {{value}} | {{source}} |\n{{/each}}\n\n### DPO checks\n\n| Check | Value | Source |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n{{#each checks}}\n| {{item}} | {{value}} | {{source}} |\n{{/each}}\n\n{{/each}}\n## AI features\n\n{{ai_summary}}\n\n| Service | Feature | Role | Risk | Obligations | Source |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n{{#each ai_features}}\n| {{service}} | {{feature}} | {{role}} | {{risk}} | {{obligations}} | {{source}} |\n{{/each}}\n\n## Outside the register\n\n{{outside_summary}}\n\n| Service | Controller | Rationale | Privacy by design | Personal data | Source |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n{{#each outside}}\n| {{service}} | {{controller}} | {{rationale}} | {{privacy_by_design}} | {{personal_data}} | {{source}} |\n{{/each}}\n\n## Not covered\n\nThis dossier prepares a review; it does not certify compliance with the GDPR or the AI Act. It holds the references of the data protection impact assessments, not the assessments themselves, and it shows only what the sources state: a processing activity, a repo or a tool missing from the compliance repo is missing from the dossier.\n",
  "register.fr.md.tmpl": "---\nspec_version: \"{{spec_version}}\"\nlanguage: {{language}}\ngenerated_at: \"{{generated_at}}\"\nopen_items: {{open_items}}\nactions: {{action_count}}\nanchors:\n{{#each anchors}}\n  {{repo}}: \"{{sha}}\"\n{{/each}}\n---\n\n# Dossier de conformité\n\n- Organisation : {{organisation}}\n- Généré le : {{generated_at}}\n\nDossier de conformité de l'organisation, construit à partir de son dépôt de conformité : l'identité de l'organisation, les actions qui ferment les points ouverts, puis pour chaque traitement son registre des activités de traitement (RGPD art. 30(1)) et ses contrôles DPO, les fonctionnalités d'IA, et ce qui reste hors du registre. La colonne Source indique d'où vient chaque valeur ; `À compléter` signifie qu'aucune source ne donne la valeur et qu'une personne doit la renseigner. Construction de ce document : `templates/register/README.md` dans le dépôt compliance-spec.\n\n> Préparé pour la revue du responsable du traitement et de son délégué à la protection des données. Ce document ne certifie pas la conformité au RGPD ni à l'AI Act.\n\n## Organisation\n\n| Élément | Valeur | Source |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n{{#each organisation_rows}}\n| {{item}} | {{value}} | {{source}} |\n{{/each}}\n\n## Actions\n\n{{actions_summary}}\n\n| Action | Rôle | Points ouverts fermés | Où |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n{{#each actions}}\n| `{{id}}`: {{label}} | {{role}} | {{count}} | {{where}} |\n{{/each}}\n\n{{#each processings}}\n## {{name}} ({{id}})\n\n### Registre des activités de traitement, RGPD art. 30(1)\n\n| Élément | Valeur | Source |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n{{#each rows}}\n| {{item}} | {{value}} | {{source}} |\n{{/each}}\n\n### Contrôles DPO\n\n| Contrôle | Valeur | Source |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n{{#each checks}}\n| {{item}} | {{value}} | {{source}} |\n{{/each}}\n\n{{/each}}\n## Fonctionnalités d'IA\n\n{{ai_summary}}\n\n| Service | Fonctionnalité | Rôle | Risque | Obligations | Source |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n{{#each ai_features}}\n| {{service}} | {{feature}} | {{role}} | {{risk}} | {{obligations}} | {{source}} |\n{{/each}}\n\n## Hors du registre\n\n{{outside_summary}}\n\n| Service | Responsable | Justification | Protection dès la conception | Données personnelles | Source |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n{{#each outside}}\n| {{service}} | {{controller}} | {{rationale}} | {{privacy_by_design}} | {{personal_data}} | {{source}} |\n{{/each}}\n\n## Non couvert\n\nCe dossier prépare une revue ; il ne certifie pas la conformité au RGPD ni à l'AI Act. Il contient les références des analyses d'impact relatives à la protection des données, pas les analyses elles-mêmes, et ne montre que ce que les sources indiquent : un traitement, un dépôt ou un outil absent du dépôt de conformité est absent du dossier.\n",
